Always-on instructions (instructions)
  Claude Code  CLAUDE.md (+ .claude/rules/*.md); AGENTS.md only when no CLAUDE.md exists
  Codex        AGENTS.md (AGENTS.override.md wins), 32 KiB budget for project files
  Antigravity  AGENTS.md or GEMINI.md (both load if both exist); rules/*.md need a trigger

User-invoked prompt (command)
  Claude Code  Slash command .claude/commands/<name>.md, merged into skills (/name)
  Codex        Custom prompts removed in rust-v0.118.0; use a skill ($name)
  Antigravity  Workflows are deprecated; use a skill (/name)

Skill (Agent Skills SKILL.md) (skill)
  Claude Code  .claude/skills/<name>/SKILL.md
  Codex        .agents/skills/<name>/SKILL.md (+ agents/openai.yaml sidecar)
  Antigravity  .agents/skills/<name>/SKILL.md, ~/.gemini/config/skills/

Subagent definition (agent)
  Claude Code  .claude/agents/<name>.md (Markdown + YAML)
  Codex        .codex/agents/<name>.toml (developer_instructions)
  Antigravity  .agents/agents/<name>.md, ~/.gemini/config/agents/ (app and CLI only)

Tool that starts a subagent (delegate)
  Claude Code  Agent (subagent_type)
  Codex        spawn_agent (agent_type)
  Antigravity  invoke_subagent

Lifecycle hooks (hook)
  Claude Code  settings.json hooks
  Codex        hooks.json or config.toml [hooks]; each hook must be trusted before it runs
  Antigravity  hooks.json

MCP servers (mcp)
  Claude Code  .mcp.json, ~/.claude.json
  Codex        config.toml [mcp_servers.<id>]
  Antigravity  mcp_config.json

Plugin bundle (plugin)
  Claude Code  .claude-plugin/plugin.json
  Codex        Reads the Claude plugin manifest
  Antigravity  plugins/<name>/plugin.json

Configuration roots (user / project) (root)
  Claude Code  ~/.claude/ / .claude/
  Codex        ~/.codex/ + ~/.agents/ / .codex/ + .agents/
  Antigravity  ~/.gemini/config/ / .agents/
